        "official_en_sha256": "7eeff0f490e132f667d6f6b75e150da328ca71ab9a468e1052f03a37f3cb041c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いつ大地がゲートに引き寄せられてもおかしくない。\r\n頂上に急ぐんだ。",
        "official_en": "The land could be sucked into the gate at any moment. We must hurry to the top.",
        "real_en": null
