        "official_en_sha256": "f00a8fa0b908d1545080e3e1a107d88f326e0df7ed3de6f358c6ac7a1bd0522e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "自分でもなぜだかわからないのですが\r\nそんな気持ちが抑えられなくて……。",
        "official_en": "I don’t quite understand it myself, but I could not suppress that feeling.",
        "real_en": null
